// Public repositories that are not publishable artifacts.
//
// Excluding something shrinks the denominator of every coverage number, so
// each row says why, and `just report` states the count. The bar is high:
// a thin project with a description stays in the corpus. Only a repository
// that a visitor could never want to be sent to belongs here.
Exclusions(
    excluded: {
        "softwarewrighter/images": "Static images for GitHub Pages: an asset host, not a project.",
        "softwarewrighter/placeholder": "Its own description is \"repo for future use\"; there is nothing to send a visitor to yet.",
    },
)
